  "description": "Automate your workflow by creating custom commands that live on your sill — trigger keyboard shortcuts or run PowerShell scripts with a single click.\n\n      • Define multi-key keyboard chords (e.g., Ctrl+K then Ctrl+D)\n      • Run PowerShell commands without opening a terminal\n      • Assign commands globally or to a specific app\n      • Customize icons\n      • Reorder commands to your liking\n\n      Your workflow, your rules — one click away.",
